{"id":"9eaa23de86feec90","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-well-founded.md","title":"Well-Founded Relation","display":"df-well-founded — Well-Founded Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-well-founded","aliases":["89-df-well-founded"],"display":"df-well-founded — Well-Founded Relation","depends_on":["[[89-df-world]]","[[89-df-accessibility]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-well-founded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-well-founded — Well-Founded Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R \\subseteq W \\times W\">\\(R \\subseteq W \\times W\\)</span> (binary relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}_W(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}_W(R)\\)</span> 是下述定义的良基性谓词，固定载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>，关系参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(R\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall S\\subseteq W\\;\n(S\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists s\\in S\\;\\forall t\\in S\\;\\neg(tRs)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall S\\subseteq W\\;\n(S\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists s\\in S\\;\\forall t\\in S\\;\\neg(tRs)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>A relation is well-founded if every non-empty subset has an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-minimal element.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-world]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-accessibility","status":"resolved","id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-accessibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\ne\\varnothing$ (see [[89-df-world]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-accessibility","status":"resolved","id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R \\subseteq W \\times W$ (binary relation, see [[89-df-accessibility]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothi